      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WILL IT BE (6) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (30.83) at this track behind LEFT TILL LAST in a Maiden. Stalked the pace but found the line strongly. One of the leading chances. BUCKETS (5) was below best at her last start when 7th at Wentworth Park following a third place finish (30.27) there two back. Should be about the money. FUNKY WOMAN (1) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when sixth at Gosford over 388m behind Thrill Seeker (23.52) in a Grade 5. Was in the money the start prior. Deserves plenty of respect. LEFT TILL LAST (8) has claims again if she runs up to the latest effort.",
